    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d139">

                <pb facs="0234" n="188" sameAs="frus:frus1914-20v02/pg188"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">811.2222/7226</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">President Wilson to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-04-11">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">11 April, 1918</hi>
                        </date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">My Dear Mr. Secretary</hi>: I have communicated to
                    the Acting Secretary of War to-day my decisions concerning aliens drafted into
                    the military service of the United States as follows:<list>
                        <label>I.</label>
                        <item>That both declarants and non-declarants of treaty countries shall in
                            all cases be promptly discharged upon the request of the accredited
                            diplomatic representatives of the countries of which they are
                            citizens.</item>
                        <label>II.</label>
                        <item>That non-declarants of non-treaty countries shall be promptly
                            discharged upon the request of the Secretary of State, and also when the
                            War Department is satisfied that a discharge should be granted in cases
                            where a full and fair hearing has not been given by the local
                            board.</item>
                    </list>
                </p>
                <p>Faithfully Yours,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>W. W.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
